# Trails close to the 1st person camera must not bend: your own trail after a U-turn runs
# alongside, starting behind you; the zig-zag's diagonal head passes right beside the camera.
wait 17
press down
wait 2
# U-turn: two rights about 0.3 s apart, so the old leg runs ~130 to the right
press right
wait 0.3
press right
wait 1
shot trail_near_uturn
press x
# cpu is a one-second average: give it two seconds to settle on the zig-zag
wait 2.5
shot trail_near_zigzag
